      "long": "A painted scene depicting a settlement on a sloping hillside in the foreground, featuring houses with terracotta roofs, light beige walls, and multiple dark brick chimneys—some emitting white smoke. Beyond the houses lies a broad expanse of blue water, possibly a bay or sea, with subtle variations in tone and visible impasto brushwork. In the distance, layered mountain ridges appear in soft blues, greys, and muted greens, fading into the horizon. The sky above is composed of blended pale blue, grey, and white strokes, suggesting an overcast or hazy day.",
